# NAME

minx - Searchable bookmarks

# SYNOPSIS

    minx [OPTIONS]

# DESCRIPTION

minx is a webserver and UI that allows users to search a database a links via
associated keywords.

Enter search terms by typing in the textbox, and press enter to navigate to the
selected page.  Keywords are alphanumeric only and are separated by
non-alphanumeric characters.  The page URL is automatically tokenized into
keywords, and so can be searched for directly as well.

Press `<C-x>` to delete the currently selected entry, and press `<C-e>` to
edit it.

Entries are edited or created by entering a complete URL as the first search
term, entering associated keywords as the following search terms, and pressing
enter.

# OPTIONS

`-i, --ip <IP>`
:   default: 127.0.0.1

`-p, --port <PORT>`
:   default: 3484

`-o, --openphrase <OPENPHRASE>`
:   default: uv-5r+plus

`-s, --sqlite-db <SQLITE_DB>`
:   default: `./minx.db`

`-h, --help`
:   Print help

`-V, --version`
:   Print version
